  "implementation": [
    "Exclusive IngestRecovery compares the full historical manifest and has no admission API or conversion to IngestStore.",
    "Explicit per-producer migration from v1 open to v2 closing preserves issued/ACK/retired; one synchronized native batch changes only that producer value. Exact retry has no native write.",
    "Current Control backend/fence/policy/lease authorizes closure of separately validated historical metadata, under retained Ingest/role SHARE and producer UPDATE locks.",
    "Native barrier precedes PG open-to-closing scheduling veto. PG already closing still requires actual native verification. Post-sync failure never compensates by reopening.",
    "Fresh event/bootstrap staging and native dispatch refuse closing, including input verified before the barrier. Missing/zero state over retained receipts is refused.",
    "Issued is a bounded boundary observation, never proof of complete interior outcome resolution or permission for ACK. Nonzero native ACK/retired currently refused.",
    "Published migrations1..14 and dependency lock unchanged; no source closure, epoch retirement, scientific fact/input/outcome/checkpoint/ACK from closing."
  ],
